					Note that
					\[
						\|z-y\|
					=
						\tfrac{\|\nabla l_x(y)\|}{L_{f,\overline\V}}
					=
						\tfrac{\|\nabla f(y)-\nabla f(x)\|}{L_{f,\overline\V}}
					\leq
						\|y-x\|,
					\]
					and in particular \(z\in \V+\cball{y}{\|y-x\|}\subseteq\overline\V\).
